1
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,799
Even a master is only human.

2
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,920
I can't hold back anymore.

3
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,359
I've absorbed so much of your negative energy,

4
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,239
and now,

5
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,719
you're all that's on my mind.

6
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:20,760
Thinking of your face,

7
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,959
thinking of your voice,

8
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:27,079
and your Pure Yin Body.

9
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,120
Connect with me.

10
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:33,200
Right here, tonight.

11
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,439
Don't move. Don't move!

12
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,000
What're you—

13
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,439
It's okay.

14
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,280
What are you doing? Let go of me!

15
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,000
Be good, just be good.

16
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,240
Let go of me! Let me go!

17
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,599
You liar!

18
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,599
You filthy liar!

19
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:20,879
Let go of me! Let me go!

20
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:21,719
Let—

21
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,879
Let go of me!

22
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:29,960
Let go of me! Let me go! Help!

23
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,919
Let go of me!

24
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,000
Help! I'm calling the cops!

25
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:38,919
I'm calling the cops!

26
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:39,759
You rapist!

27
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:41,800
The cops? Call the cops?!

28
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:43,479
I gave you the money!

29
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,520
I took care of your business!

30
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:46,960
And you won't be with me?

31
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,280
Why the hell won't you be with me?!

32
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,080
Did you lose out by being with me?!

33
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,960
You damn jinx!

34
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:58,599
Who else would dare be with you besides me? Who?!

35
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,879
Who's this kid?

36
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:04,199
Where am I now?

37
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,879
Why can't I remember anything?

38
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:16,759
Did my memories get sealed away?

39
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:27,639
You're awake.

40
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:30,879
Last night...

41
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,879
...was pretty wild, huh?

42
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,519
That was a great idea of yours.

43
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,800
I knew I wasn't wrong about you.

44
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:44,199
We'll do it your way.

45
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:48,879
Your brother's back.

46
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:49,680
What?

47
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,720
Get over here!

48
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,040
Hide! Hide!

49
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:00,120
Who?

50
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,879
What's what?

51
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,160
Who's begging who?

52
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,480
This is...

53
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,839
Wait, what the hell is this?

54
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,600
Babe.

55
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:12,199
Hubby.

56
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,519
Waiting for me, huh?

57
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,600
Love you, babe.

58
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,639
Mwah.

59
00:05:17,839 --> 00:05:18,639
Mwah.

60
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,920
Love you, babe.

61
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,199
Okay, okay.

62
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,079
You drank too much.

63
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,240
Got my energy back!

64
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:28,040
Full of energy! Come on, hurry, hurry!

65
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,720
No, no, no.

66
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,000
Hurry up.

67
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,639
You...

68
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,040
Hurry up.

69
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,240
Don't.

70
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,160
Don't.

71
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:36,959
What?

72
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:40,000
What? I'm your husband.

73
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,519
My period started today.

74
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,720
Whose period?

75
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,439
Mine.

76
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,920
Let me count...

77
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,240
That came early, then.

78
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,319
Yeah, it's early.

79
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,439
All right, then.

80
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,800
Weren't you out making deliveries?

81
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:59,319
Deliveries my ass.

82
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:00,759
I quit.

83
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:04,399
That boss treats people based on status.

84
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:05,560
I quit.

85
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,920
If you quit, what are we gonna eat?

86
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:08,879
Don't worry about what I'll eat.

87
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,240
Let me tell you,

88
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,519
supporting you is no problem.

89
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:14,160
I've got plenty of connections.

90
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:16,439
Hold on, let me call my brother.

91
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:17,279
My cousin.

92
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,279
My cousin's got serious connections.

93
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:22,680
He found me an awesome gig.

94
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:27,199
He told me, "Bro, as long as you use your strength..."

95
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,519
Strength is all I've got!

96
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:33,040
Right now, all I've got is str—

97
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,399
Don't.

98
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:35,480
All I've got is strength!

99
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,480
I said—I told you—

100
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:37,959
What?

101
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:39,439
I told you, I can't today!

102
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:41,079
Hang on, let me make a call, make a call.

103
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:41,480
Don't.

104
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,079
Stop pulling me.

105
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,920
What is it? You're drunk.

106
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,879
No, let me make a call.

107
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:47,800
You're drunk.

108
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,879
Let me ask him about this.

109
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,240
Or else I won't have work.

110
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,879
Hubby...

111
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:52,639
I'm...

112
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:54,839
I'm hungry.

113
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:55,879
Hungry?

114
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,519
I was thinking—I was just about to say,

115
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,399
"Let's go grab something good to eat."

116
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,399
I'm tired.

117
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:01,199
Something good, alright?

118
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:01,920
It's ringing.

119
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,839
The phone's ringing.

120
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,800
It's not ringing.

121
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:09,240
Waiting for him to pick up. Hello? Hello?

122
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:13,439
Cut off again.

123
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:13,839
Come on, hubby.

124
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:14,759
What? What?

125
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,680
Let's go get good food.

126
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,439
Grab food, right?

127
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:22,079
Let's go.

128
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,199
Let's go.

129
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:25,360
Whatever my wife wants!

130
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,399
We'll drink! Drink up!

131
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:28,160
All right.

132
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,759
Let's go.

133
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:30,040
Let's go.

134
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,040
Let me put my shoes on.

135
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,240
No big deal!

136
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,160
Right?

137
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,560
You—babe, put some clothes on.

138
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,079
You're drunk.

139
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:36,680
You're drunk.

140
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,160
No, put your clothes on and let's go.

141
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,079
I... I...

142
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,360
It's fine, put it on.

143
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,439
You... you...

144
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:42,639
It's nothing.

145
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:43,439
I got it, I got it.

146
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:44,519
I've got strength.

147
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,040
As long as I have strength,

148
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,079
I can make money for you.

149
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:47,720
I'll take care of you.

150
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,399
None of this is a big deal.

151
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,000
Okay.

152
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,279
It's nothing at all.

153
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,720
Bro.

154
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:13,600
Nah, bro.

155
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,680
I was just taking a shower.

156
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,759
Missed your call.

157
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,199
Go ahead, bro.

158
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:23,240
That thing with Brother Liang?

159
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:26,319
I kept meaning to call you back, but it slipped my mind.

160
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:28,920
No problem, no problem at all.

161
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,199
We're all friends here.

162
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:35,399
Don't worry, just wait to hear from me.

163
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,679
Just leave it to me, alright?

164
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,960
Sounds good, bro.

165
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,559
Brother Liang.

166
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,519
Brother Liang.

167
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:04,279
Who's this?

168
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,200
Is that Brother Liang?

169
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,840
Xiao Guan?

170
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,519
You finally remembered me, kid.

171
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:18,480
It's Xiao Guan, bro.

172
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:19,960
I wanted to ask,

173
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,039
how are things with my brother?

174
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:24,200
As long as he can work, quit stalling.

175
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,720
Hurry up and bring him over.

176
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,320
I'm at the brickyard.

177
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,360
I already cleared things with Old Ding.

178
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,240
This time is just great.

179
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,720
Not a single clue left.

180
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,200
A total blackout.

181
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,399
Fine, so I blacked out.

182
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:56,879
Not a bad-looking face, though.

183
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,360
Wait, why am I even thinking about that now?

184
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,240
Where am I?

185
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,960
3709.

186
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,799
Where's this key from, then?

187
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,639
First, let's find a place to crash.

188
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,919
Once settled, I can slowly figure things out.

189
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,120
No problem.

190
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,720
Find a place to crash.

191
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,720
Find a place to stay.

192
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,000
Then slowly figure it out.

193
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,519
It'll all make sense in time.

194
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,039
It'll be fine.

195
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:54,600
No problem.

196
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,600
Find a place to stay.

197
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,559
Well, if it isn't Xiao Guan!

198
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,519
No girl with you today?

199
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:10,360
A room, please, boss. Thanks.

200
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,559
Just you?

201
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,120
You're alone, not sleeping at home?

202
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:20,559
I bet...

203
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:22,440
you don't know where I live.

204
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,840
Bet you can't tell me.

205
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:26,080
You out of your mind today?

206
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,960
Don't you live right across the street?

207
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,399
At the video parlor.

208
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,559
Give me my money back.

209
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,679
I gotta hurry home to get my head checked.

210
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:40,480
Xiao Guan, Xiao Guan.

211
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,639
Play more of those movies.

212
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,279
Whenever you play them, business booms.

213
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:44,159
I'll give you a cut.

214
00:13:29,879 --> 00:13:31,600
They're always playing cards over there.

215
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,120
Come on, pay up! Pay up, pay up!

216
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:37,919
Cough it up, pay up!

217
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:39,840
Pay up and cut the crap.

218
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,399
I'm short on cash.

219
00:13:40,879 --> 00:13:41,840
Won again!

220
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:44,120
Not enough? Usual rules, then.

221
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,960
Work it off in shifts.

222
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,519
Winning hand!

223
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,679
Hey, my buddy's here.

224
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,639
Brother Liang, this is my cousin.

225
00:13:48,799 --> 00:13:49,440
Brother Liang.

226
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,759
This time he really wants to keep his head down,

227
00:13:52,759 --> 00:13:54,000
find a job and make some cash.

228
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:54,360
Right.

229
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,200
Please give him a shot.

230
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,039
Give him a chance.

231
00:13:57,919 --> 00:13:59,480
Did you already forget...

232
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,559
how you got kicked out of my place?

233
00:14:01,559 --> 00:14:02,600
Got amnesia or something?

234
00:14:02,879 --> 00:14:04,080
My bad, my bad.

235
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,559
You two know each other?

236
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,240
Ask your cousin.

237
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,960
You played cards with me before, didn't you?

238
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,519
Yeah.

239
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:11,639
Tried to pull a fast one on me, too.

240
00:14:11,759 --> 00:14:12,960
So I beat the crap out of you.

241
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,159
Am I right?

242
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,759
No, well...

243
00:14:16,759 --> 00:14:18,200
I stopped pulling that crap long ago.

244
00:14:18,279 --> 00:14:19,600
I turned over a new leaf already.

245
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,840
I'm telling you, Brother Liang,

246
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,519
I really...

247
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:23,240
I've totally quit it now.

248
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,840
My wife can vouch for me.

249
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,240
Yeah.

250
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:26,759
Right, right, right.

251
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:27,799
He's changed, he's not like that anymore.

252
00:14:27,799 --> 00:14:28,720
Give him a shot, just one shot.

253
00:14:30,399 --> 00:14:31,679
I'll do it as a favor to you.

254
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,120
Don't just stand there.

255
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:35,799
Take him to get changed.

256
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:36,919
Right, right, hurry up and go change!

257
00:14:36,919 --> 00:14:38,320
May you strike it rich! All the best to you!

258
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:38,919
Get back here quick.

259
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,919
Bro, let me take over this hand.

260
00:14:40,919 --> 00:14:41,360
Sure.

261
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,480
Come on, let's go.

262
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,120
Who are you?

263
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:56,799
Me.

264
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,240
Li Ermiao.

265
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,159
Don't remember me?

266
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,639
Fu Ting.

267
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,960
I'm Zhang Xiaomin.

268
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,519
Xiao Guan.

269
00:16:10,639 --> 00:16:12,279
You don't remember me?

270
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,960
Fu Ting...

271
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:19,279
I died an unjust death.

272
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,000
Their family is so happy.

273
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,080
Why do my wife and I have to suffer?

274
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,120
I'm gonna kill them.

275
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,279
Put on something exciting.

276
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:36,080
What kind of exciting?

277
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,960
Exciting and illegal. Wanna watch?

278
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:38,639
Yeah.

279
00:16:38,639 --> 00:16:39,320
Nowhere near as good as yesterday's.

280
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:42,120
Just watch.

281
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,240
It's worse than yesterday's.

282
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,399
Still gotta watch it.

283
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:45,919
Still worse than yesterday's.
